sequenceDiagram
    participant Sender as 发送方
    participant Server as 服务器
    participant Receiver as 接收方

    Note over Sender: 准备：明文消息 + stego_key

    rect rgb(240, 244, 248)
    Sender->>Sender: 1. AES-256-GCM 加密明文<br/>生成 SealedMessage
    Sender->>Sender: 2. 隐写嵌入<br/>密文嵌入载密图像
    end

    Sender->>Server: 3. 上传载密图像
    Server->>Server: 存储并转发
    Server->>Receiver: 4. 推送载密图像

    rect rgb(240, 244, 248)
    Receiver->>Receiver: 5. 隐写提取<br/>从载图提取密文
    Receiver->>Receiver: 6. AES-256-GCM 解密<br/>还原明文消息
    end

    Note over Receiver: 结果：明文消息
